-Yes.

538
00:21:47,139 --> 00:21:49,007
-Jong-won and Nam-no.
-And Nam-no.

539
00:21:49,074 --> 00:21:50,942
I'll go for the second one.

540
00:21:51,009 --> 00:21:52,277
-What?
-What?

541
00:21:52,344 --> 00:21:54,746
I've been avoiding him for too long.

542
00:21:54,813 --> 00:21:56,515
-Finally.
-You've been avoiding him.

543
00:21:56,581 --> 00:21:57,916
I have,

544
00:21:57,983 --> 00:21:59,418
