545
00:21:59,751 --> 00:22:00,786
A HEAD-ON MATCH

546
00:22:00,852 --> 00:22:02,988
-It's time for me to fight him.
-I see.

547
00:22:03,055 --> 00:22:04,923
Headbutt him today.

548
00:22:04,990 --> 00:22:06,958
I'll headbutt him.

549
00:22:07,759 --> 00:22:10,929
