-Yes.

557
00:22:24,409 --> 00:22:26,511
The first round
is The Grown Woman, Han Yu-ju Core.

558
00:22:26,578 --> 00:22:30,082
Let us begin the cook-off
between Jong-won and Eun-yeong!

559
00:22:30,382 --> 00:22:32,818
STARTING NOW

560
