<i>This is the first cook-off</i>
<i>with Jung-an's ingredients.</i>

561
00:22:37,255 --> 00:22:39,391
The good vibes core of the show,

562
00:22:39,458 --> 00:22:41,059
Chef Son Jong-won,

563
00:22:41,126 --> 00:22:43,061
