582
00:23:27,639 --> 00:23:29,608
THEN SHE ACTUALLY GOT A SHAVER AS A GIFT

583
00:23:29,674 --> 00:23:31,610
She's more like a grown dude,
not a grown woman?

584
00:23:31,676 --> 00:23:33,011
