-Whoa.

587
00:23:39,017 --> 00:23:40,085
Is that so?

588
00:23:40,152 --> 00:23:42,521
Yes, she uses tools too.

589
00:23:42,754 --> 00:23:44,089
ADMITS COOLLY

590
00:23:44,156 --> 00:23:46,258
A MUST-HAVE TOOL FOR GROWN WOMEN

591
00:23:46,324 --> 00:23:47,993
That hairstyle is how

592
00:23:48,059 --> 00:23:51,296
-Gong Yoo tied my hair in the drama.
-Yes, that's right.

593
00:23:51,663 --> 00:23:53,031
HOW LOVELY

