so I can't bring it back to the middle.

599
00:24:04,543 --> 00:24:07,612
When that happens, just change your part.

600
00:24:07,679 --> 00:24:10,749
You're right.
It depends on the direction of my part.

601
00:24:10,816 --> 00:24:12,250
Switch it to the other side.

602
00:24:12,584 --> 00:24:14,753
WILL SHE CAPTURE
THE GROWN WOMAN'S APPETITE?

