00:24:17,689 --> 00:24:19,758
BRIOCHE, BURRATA, CHILI PASTE,
TOMATO SOUP, CABBAGE SAUCE, AND MORE

605
00:24:19,825 --> 00:24:22,160
What are you making, Eun-yeong?

606
00:24:22,227 --> 00:24:24,696
Here's the name of my dish.

607
00:24:24,763 --> 00:24:26,331
Yu-ju, the grown woman,

608
00:24:26,398 --> 00:24:28,934
has the image of someone

609
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:32,070
who'd probably eat brunch
at a café in Hannam-dong.

610
00:24:32,137 --> 00:24:33,538
Instead of an ordinary brunch dish,

611
00:24:33,605 --> 00:24:36,708
I prepared a Chinese brunch
with a hint of Chinese flavors.

612
00:24:36,775 --> 00:24:38,343
-So…
-Chinese brunch?

613
00:24:38,410 --> 00:24:41,813
…I'll make shrimp toasts
with salad on top,

614
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:43,882
as well as tomato soup in Hong Kong style.

615
00:24:43,949 --> 00:24:47,686
-I'll make Chinese-style brunch for you.
-I see.

616
00:24:48,520 --> 00:24:50,856
CHEF JONG-WON'S INGREDIENTS:
RIBEYE, PASTA, NURUNGJI SNACK

617
00:24:50,922 --> 00:24:53,258
GRANA PADANO, FLATBREAD, CREAM CHEESE,
HUMMUS, MILK, TRUFFLE SALT, AND MORE

618
00:24:53,325 --> 00:24:55,393
What are you making, Jong-won?

619
00:24:55,460 --> 00:24:56,962
The name of my dish is

620
00:24:57,028 --> 00:24:59,164
Parfait Princess.

621
00:24:59,231 --> 00:25:01,566
-Parfait Princess.
-Parfait Princess.

622
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:03,101
A-HA

623
00:25:03,168 --> 00:25:06,071
-Pa-Pri.
-Pa-Pri.

624
00:25:06,137 --> 00:25:09,307
Back in my day,
something that represented grown women

625
00:25:09,374 --> 00:25:11,910
-was parfait.
-Parfait.

626
00:25:11,977 --> 00:25:13,278
When cafés were a thing,

627
00:25:13,345 --> 00:25:17,349
grown women would sit there alone
brushing their hair back

628
00:25:17,415 --> 00:25:20,652
