-He has no time.

686
00:27:41,459 --> 00:27:42,293
Exactly.

687
00:27:42,927 --> 00:27:45,230
-Eleven? He's using meat?
-Eleven is a lot.

688
00:27:45,296 --> 00:27:47,499
-He'll have to do a lot.
-He will.

689
00:27:47,565 --> 00:27:50,168
He'll need a huge cup too.

690
00:27:50,235 --> 00:27:52,103
It's interesting that
he'll make 11 layers.

691
00:27:52,170 --> 00:27:54,072
It's an emergency.

692
00:27:54,406 --> 00:27:56,374
A GROWN MAN DOES NOT GET FLUSTERED

693
00:27:56,441 --> 00:27:58,576
I hope he isn't overly ambitious.

694
00:27:59,244 --> 00:28:00,512
SITS BACK DOWN…

695
00:28:00,578 --> 00:28:02,847
He's using the corn now.

696
00:28:03,882 --> 00:28:06,451
-How will he put 11 things in a cup?
-Right?

697
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:07,886
Wouldn't the flavors get mixed up?

698
00:28:08,186 --> 00:28:10,255
HE CONTINUES WITHOUT GETTING SHAKEN

699
00:28:10,889 --> 00:28:11,756
AND THE GROWN WOMAN?

700
00:28:11,823 --> 00:28:14,225
She's going to grind the shrimp.

701
00:28:14,292 --> 00:28:15,927
She's making a shrimp toast.

702
00:28:15,994 --> 00:28:19,330
She has to make the shrimp toast,
so she'll have to grind the shrimp.

703
00:28:19,397 --> 00:28:21,599
2. GRIND SHRIMP, EGG YOLK, SALT,
GREEN ONION, AND SESAME OIL

704
00:28:21,666 --> 00:28:24,002
When I want to eat a huge dinner,

705
00:28:24,069 --> 00:28:26,538
I usually order a dinner set
from a Chinese restaurant.

706
00:28:26,604 --> 00:28:29,074
-And it always comes with shrimp toast.
-Shrimp toast.

707
00:28:29,140 --> 00:28:31,342
-So you like it.
-Yes.

708
00:28:31,409 --> 00:28:32,410
She likes shrimp toast.

709
00:28:32,477 --> 00:28:33,411
ALL RIGHT!

710
00:28:33,478 --> 00:28:35,747
-Bread.
-There's bread.

711
00:28:35,814 --> 00:28:38,383
It's made with lots of butter.

712
00:28:38,450 --> 00:28:40,618
-It's brioche.
-Yes.

713
00:28:42,087 --> 00:28:43,655
Just like that?

714
00:28:43,722 --> 00:28:44,823
Just one side.

715
00:28:46,091 --> 00:28:49,127
She said she'd top it with salad.

716
